            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <mtext>How does a file created by an artist become</mtext>
              </mtd>
            </mtr>
            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <mtext>an immutable runtime resource, while</mtext>
              </mtd>
            </mtr>
            <mtr>
